      <table class="compare-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Feature</th>
            <th class="col-arthavi">Arthavi</th>
            <th>Kuvera (Groww)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Independence</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Fully independent — not owned by any broker</td>
            <td>Owned by Groww (discount broker)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Price</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">₹0 — Free forever, no brokerage</td>
            <td>Free tracking, monetizes via brokerage</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Privacy</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Zero data selling, no broker passwords</td>
            <td>Broker account integration, Groww data ecosystem</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Import Method</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">CAS PDF upload (30 sec)</td>
            <td>Broker login / Groww account</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Family Portfolio</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Free multi-profile family tracking</td>
            <td>Family accounts (within Groww ecosystem)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>AI Features</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Ask AI: overlap, sector, risk analysis</td>
            <td>None — basic analytics only</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Stock Tracking</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Cross-broker — any NSE/BSE stock</td>
            <td>Groww-held stocks only</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Trade Execution</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">None — tracking only (unbiased)</td>
            <td>Full trading platform</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Conflict of Interest</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">Zero — no commissions, no brokerage</td>
            <td>Earns on every trade you make</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Cross-broker View</strong></td>
            <td class="col-arthavi">All brokers via CAS import</td>
            <td>Primarily Groww holdings</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2>What makes Arthavi the best independent Kuvera replacement?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No broker ownership</strong> — Arthavi is not owned by Zerodha, Groww, or any execution platform. Analytics remain 100% unbiased.</li>
      <li><strong>Cross-broker consolidation</strong> — Import <a href="/guides/cas-statement-explained/">CAS statements</a> from CAMS/KFintech to see holdings from all brokers in one view.</li>
      <li><strong>AI portfolio doctor</strong> — Get <a href="/ask-ai-investment-assistant/">AI-powered insights</a> on fund overlap, sector concentration, and portfolio health.</li>
      <li><strong>Family portfolios</strong> — Track Self, Spouse, Parents, and Children under one free account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>When should you stay with Groww/Kuvera?</h2>
    <p>Kuvera (now Groww) is still useful if you:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Want to <strong>buy and sell</strong> direct mutual funds and stocks from one platform</li>
      <li>Are comfortable with your tracking data living inside a broker's ecosystem</li>
      <li>Use Groww as your primary broker and want integrated P&L</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you want an <strong>independent, unbiased tracking layer</strong> that works across all brokers — Arthavi is the better choice.</p>

    <h2>How to switch from Kuvera to Arthavi?</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Download your <a href="/guides/how-to-import-cas-cams-kfintech-nsdl/">CAMS/KFintech CAS statement</a> (covers all AMCs, not just Groww)</li>
      <li>Create a free <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register">Arthavi account</a></li>
      <li>Upload your CAS — full mutual fund portfolio appears in 30 seconds</li>
      <li>Add stocks from any broker via CSV or manual entry</li>
    </ol>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0;">
      <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/demo" class="btn btn-demo" style="padding: 1rem 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">
        Try Arthavi Demo — No Signup Required
      </a>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted);">No broker login. No spam calls. Your data stays yours.</p>
